SyncNonPaidOrders = Sync non-paid orders
SyncNonPaidOrdersHelp = Enable this option to also synchronize orders that don't have the "Paid" status in Shopify (useful for Ankorstore and other marketplaces with deferred payment). By default, only orders with "Paid" status are synchronized. This setting applies to ALL import paths: Shopify webhooks (create, update, paid), automatic catch-up and historical import.
AutoCreateInvoice = Automatically create draft invoice
AutoCreateInvoiceHelp = Automatically creates a draft invoice in Dolibarr for each imported Shopify order. The invoice is linked to the order and remains in draft status for manual validation.
AutoValidateInvoice = Automatically validate invoice
AutoValidateInvoiceHelp = Automatically validates the invoice after creation (invoice moves from draft to validated and receives an official number). Requires "Automatically create draft invoice" to be enabled. Disable to keep invoices in draft and validate manually.
# Story 12.2: Differentiate orders/create and orders/paid
# Story 12.3: Automatic payment creation from Shopify
AutoCreatePayment = Automatically create payment
AutoCreatePaymentHelp = Automatically creates a Dolibarr payment when an orders/paid webhook is received from Shopify. The payment is linked to the invoice, recorded in the bank if the Bank module is active, and the invoice is marked as paid. Requires "Automatically create draft invoice" and "Automatically validate invoice" to be enabled.
AutoCreateExpedition = Automatically create shipment
AutoCreateExpeditionHelp = Automatically creates a shipment in Dolibarr when a Shopify order is marked as fulfilled. The shipment is validated and tracking information is recorded.
AutoCloseOrder = Automatically close orders
AutoCloseOrderHelp = Closes the Dolibarr order when all lines are fully shipped. Enabled by default. If disabled, the order remains in "Partially shipped" status even when all lines are delivered.
