# Story 56.1: real product photo diagnostic (replaces the old documents/documents_download test against the company logo)
DiagProductPhotoOldPathLabel = Product photo path (real test)
DiagProductPhotoOldPathValue = Old format detected (PRODUCT_USE_OLD_PATH_FOR_PHOTO=1)
DiagProductPhotoOldPathHelp = Your product photos are stored in the old Dolibarr directory format. The module still finds them (direct access tries both formats), but this setting remains a frequent source of confusion — see docs/troubleshooting/IMAGES_FAQ.md for the migration procedure.
DiagProductPhotoTestLabel = Real product image retrieval test
DiagProductPhotoTestSkipped = Skipped
DiagProductPhotoTestSkippedHelp = No product with at least one photo (indexed in the database OR present on disk) was found in a sample of 50 products in this Dolibarr installation. This test cannot run until at least one product has a photo.
DiagProductPhotoDiskOnlyValue = Photos found on disk, not indexed (product %s)
DiagProductPhotoDiskOnlyHelp = At least one product has photos on disk with no matching row in llx_ecm_files — they will NEVER be synced to Shopify until the index is rebuilt. Common cause: a migration, a backup restore, or files dropped outside the Dolibarr interface. Fix: reindex the product documents in Dolibarr (or re-upload the photo via the product sheet).
DiagProductPhotoTestProductLabel = Tested product (image diagnostic)
DiagProductPhotoUnexpectedError = Unexpected error

# Story 57-4: product photo diagnostic via DIRECT ACCESS (DolibarrDirectFileResolver), replaces the self REST API replay (Story 56.1)
DiagProductPhotoDirLabel = Resolved product photos directory
DiagProductPhotoDirUnresolvedValue = Not resolved
DiagProductPhotoDirUnresolvedHelp = The product photo storage directory (multidir_output) could not be resolved. Check the Products module configuration in Dolibarr (Setup > Modules > Products).
DiagProductPhotoDirNotFoundValue = Directory not found on disk
DiagProductPhotoDirNotFoundHelp = The resolved directory does not exist on the server. Check the Dolibarr document storage path (multidir_output) and available disk space.
DiagProductPhotoDirNotReadableValue = Directory not readable
DiagProductPhotoDirNotReadableHelp = The directory exists but the PHP process does not have read permission. Common on shared hosting: check the directory permissions (chmod) and its owner.
DiagProductPhotoFileMissingOnDiskValue = %s indexed image(s), 0 found on disk
DiagProductPhotoFileMissingOnDiskHelp = The product has images indexed in the database (llx_ecm_files) but no matching file is present on disk. Likely database/disk desynchronization — check whether a backup/restore omitted the files, or the disk was purged.
DiagProductPhotoNoIndexedImagesValue = No image indexed for this product
DiagProductPhotoNoIndexedImagesHelp = The directory is accessible but no image is indexed for this product. Normally unexpected here (the tested product was selected because it has an indexed image) — report this case if it persists.
DiagProductPhotoOkValue = %s image(s) found on disk
DiagProductPhotoOkHelp = The module successfully listed this product's images directly from disk, without going through the Dolibarr REST API.
