UnderpriceAuditTitle=Audit Underpriced Orders (Tax-Excluded)
UnderpriceAuditIntro=Lists Shopify orders imported before the e825f456 fix on a tax-excluded store, whose recorded amount is undervalued (division by 1+VAT applied to an already tax-excluded price). No Shopify network call — detection is based on the historical note already stored locally.
UnderpriceAuditWarning=This tool is NOT an automatic corrector: it NEVER writes to an order, an invoice, or a payment. It only lists the orders concerned and the amount at stake — the accounting treatment (credit note) remains a decision and an action of the client, outside this tool.
